,.$ If $\\,{v}_{1}+{v}_{2}=0\\,$ and $\\,T({v}_{2})=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]\\,$, find $\\,T(11{v}_{1}+6{v}_{2}).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we have that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}11{v}_{1}+6{v}_{2} & =11{v}_{1}+11{v}_{2}-5{v}_{2} \\\\  & =11({v}_{1}+{v}_{2})-5{v}_{2} \\\\  & =11(0)-5{v}_{2} \\\\  & =-5{v}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nT(11{v}_{1}+6{v}_{2})=T(-5{v}_{2}).\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, since $T$ is a linear transformation, we have that $T(kv)=kT(v).$ So \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(-5{v}_{2}) & =-5T({v}_{2}) \\\\  & =-5[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-35 \\\\ -40 \\\\ -45\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn conclusion, $T(11{v}_{1}+6{v}_{2})=[\\begin{aligned}-35 \\\\ -40 \\\\ -45\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-74782/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9fbd335c-28cc-5f02-b773-f685e8b15417"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74782"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74777/selection/f9c98954f885209cf0eca684916d852c1afec31aa050e95cde8d0432cc5eff63" :answer/id #uuid "108e5913-388b-5f47-b05c-08dba4e4d65f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ 26 \\\\ -14\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74777/selection/459fe0f4a7133dabd504b7839f74baf9d00ced9f21e2e4839dffd89f12b38197" :answer/id #uuid "9266ea0c-fba6-5de0-bc11-ed9c2cc49460" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}21 \\\\ -39 \\\\ 21\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74777/selection/becf90e4daf627a4d2140af091b3b369933b4590a59ed7da29d74bc9cee8300b" :answer/id #uuid "13395b9e-9033-5fa5-929b-fd9524d93cc6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-40 \\\\ 130 \\\\ -70\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74777/selection/14f29186aaf554e5e1542af35beb4e1a1442ae34fdf726